From: BESSER STATEC hackathon team <besser@list.lu>
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] fix(react): readable chart axes, labels and values

Large numbers on value axes and in tooltips were printed in full
(25000000000), and horizontal bar charts gave category labels the default
60 px, so longer names wrapped and overlapped. Value axes now use compact
numbers (25B), tooltips thousands separators, horizontal bars a 190 px
label column with long names shortened and a height that grows with the
number of bars, and MetricCard gets a "compact" format.
---

